Composite tools: sharp_composite_ps, ps_const_log, ps_const_mul, log_quad_draws

- sharp_composite_ps: extra pixel shader hashes that get the bioshock_sharp_composite treatment
  (BioShock 2 multiplayer's composite is 4B7A33E482E2DF58).
- ps_const_log / ps_const_mul: log or scale float constants of chosen pixel shaders
  (multiplayer bloom strength is c1 of that composite).
- log_quad_draws: diagnostic that lists post-process passes once per pixel shader.
All off by default.

